      <div><span class="ens-page__trio-t"><span class="ens-page__num"><bdi dir="ltr">1</bdi></span>ביטול עד <bdi dir="ltr">14</bdi> ימים מקבלת המוצר</span><p>לפי חוק הגנת הצרכן. כאשר הדין מאפשר דמי ביטול — <bdi dir="ltr">5%</bdi> ממחיר העסקה או <bdi dir="ltr">100</bdi> ₪, הנמוך מביניהם.</p></div>
      <div><span class="ens-page__trio-t"><span class="ens-page__num"><bdi dir="ltr">2</bdi></span>מוצר פגום, חסר או שגוי</span><p>פנו אלינו בהקדם עם מספר ההזמנה ותמונות ברורות של הבעיה. בביטול שנובע מפגם, מאי־התאמה או מאי־אספקה במועד — לא נגבים דמי ביטול.</p></div>
      <div><span class="ens-page__trio-t"><span class="ens-page__num"><bdi dir="ltr">3</bdi></span>אל תשלחו מוצר לפני קבלת הנחיות</span><p>פתחו בקשת החזרה וקבלו מאיתנו הנחיות כתובות. כתובת ההחזרה נמסרת בהתאם למוצר ולמסלול המשלוח.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="ens-page__note">הנוסח המחייב: <a href="{{ ens_ref_pol }}">מדיניות הביטולים, ההחזרות וההחזרים</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="env2-wrap ens-page__sec">
    <h2 class="env2-h ens-page__h2">עברו <bdi dir="ltr">17</bdi> ימי עסקים והחבילה לא הגיעה?</h2>
    <p class="ens-page__intro">פנו אלינו עם מספר ההזמנה, האימייל ששימש לרכישה ותיאור קצר — נבדוק מול חברת השילוח ונחזור אליכם עם תשובה.</p>
    <div class="ens-page__cta">
      <a class="env2-btn" href="{{ ens_contact }}">ליצירת קשר</a>
      <a class="env2-link" href="{{ ens_proc }}">מה קורה אחרי שהזמנתם <span aria-hidden="true">&#8592;</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- endif -%}

{%- when 'contact' -%}
{%- comment -%} ============================ 7. CONTACT ============================ {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- render 'elmsnest-s-page-photo',
      image: section.settings.img_contact_band, asset: 'ens-page-contact-band.jpg', w: 1600, h: 870,
      kicker: 'מקום', caption: section.settings.cap_contact_band, credit: section.settings.cred_contact_band, credit_url: 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Baha%27i_Garden,_Haifa_(3756370163).jpg',
      alt: section.settings.alt_contact_band, pos: section.settings.pos_contact_band, pos_d: section.settings.posd_contact_band,
      band: true -%}
  <div class="env2-wrap ens-page__head">
    <h1 id="{{ ens_h1_id }}" class="env2-h ens-page__h1">{{ ens_h1_html }}</h1>
    {%- if ens_lead_html != '' -%}<p class="ens-page__lead">{{ ens_lead_html }}</p>{%- endif -%}
    {%- comment -%} the stock Kalles form column prints the same address; the checkbox drops this one without touching the template (P2: one email line per page) {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if ens_mail != '' and section.settings.contact_email_line -%}
    <p class="ens-page__email">דוא״ל: <a href="mailto:{{ ens_mail | escape }}"><bdi dir="ltr">{{ ens_mail | escape }}</bdi></a></p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

{%- else -%}
{%- comment -%} ==================== ELSE — any other page, plain prose ==================== {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="env2-wrap ens-page__head">
    <h1 id="{{ ens_h1_id }}" class="env2-h ens-page__h1">{{ ens_h1_html }}</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="env2-wrap ens-page__sec">
    <div class="ens-page__prose ens-page__rte">{{ page.content }}</div>
  </div>

{%- endcase -%}
</section>

<style>
/* ---------- the page shell (tokens from elmsnest-v2-core; the night ground is painted on <body>) ---------- */
.ens-page{--ens-page-line:var(--env2-hair);padding-block:0 56px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--env2-ink)}
.ens-page p{margin:0}
.ens-page__head{padding-block:26px 0}
.ens-page__head--lead{padding-block-start:18px}
.ens-page__h1.env2-h{font-size:32px;line-height:1.06;margin:0;color:var(--env2-ink);max-inline-size:19ch}
.ens-page__lead{margin-block-start:14px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--env2-ink-2);max-inline-size:60ch}
.ens-page .ens-page__lead a,.ens-page .ens-page__note a,.ens-page .ens-page__faq a,.ens-page .ens-page__prose a,.ens-page .ens-page__email a{color:var(--env2-ink);border-block-end:1px solid var(--env2-hair-btn);padding-block-end:1px;transition:color .3s,border-color .3s}
.ens-page .ens-page__lead a:hover,.ens-page .ens-page__note a:hover,.ens-page .ens-page__faq a:hover,.ens-page .ens-page__prose a:hover,.ens-page .ens-page__email a:hover,
.ens-page .ens-page__lead a:focus-visible,.ens-page .ens-page__note a:focus-visible,.ens-page .ens-page__faq a:focus-visible,.ens-page .ens-page__prose a:focus-visible,.ens-page .ens-page__email a:focus-visible{color:var(--env2-glow);border-color:var(--env2-glow)}

/* ---------- the photograph (snippets/elmsnest-s-page-photo) ----------
   band: full-bleed, 220 px at 390 and 300 px at >= 901 — the R3 cap, so the first decision is at the
   fold. inline: inside the reading wrap at 3:2. block-size:auto is required or the height attribute
   (a presentational hint) beats aspect-ratio and the frame grows.
   __box is the photograph's own box and the ONLY positioning context: the figcaption sits in normal
   flow inside the figure element, so an overlay positioned against the figure lands on the caption and
   slides with it. The on-band h1 and the bottom fade are pinned to __box instead, so they sit on the
   photograph at any caption height. The caption stays outside the box, under the picture. */
.ens-page__fig{margin:0;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:0}
.ens-page__box{position:relative;isolation:isolate;overflow:hidden;background:#05070c}
.ens-page__fig--band{inline-size:100%}
.ens-page__fig--band img{inline-size:100%;block-size:220px;object-fit:cover;object-position:var(--ens-op,50% 50%)}
.ens-page__fig--inline img{inline-size:100%;block-size:auto;aspect-ratio:3 / 2;object-fit:cover;object-position:var(--ens-op,50% 50%)}
/* the bottom fade guards the 4.5:1 floor under an on-band h1 and is drawn only there */
.ens-page__fig--h1 .ens-page__box::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset-inline:0;inset-block-end:0;block-size:36%;pointer-events:none;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(2,3,6,0) 0%,rgba(2,3,6,.62) 100%);z-index:0}
.ens-page__onband{position:absolute;inset-inline:0;inset-block-end:20px;z-index:1;pointer-events:none}
.ens-page__h1--on.env2-h{text-shadow:0 2px 24px rgba(2,3,6,.6)}
.ens-page__figcap{margin:0}
.ens-page__cap{padding-block-start:10px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--env2-ink-2);max-inline-size:44ch}
.ens-page__kick{font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--env2-gold)}
.ens-page__dot{margin-inline:7px;color:var(--env2-mute)}
.ens-page__credit{padding-block-start:3px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--env2-mute)}
.ens-page .ens-page__credit a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;border-block-end:1px solid var(--env2-hair);padding-block-end:1px;transition:color .3s,border-color .3s}
.ens-page .ens-page__credit a:hover,.ens-page .ens-page__credit a:focus-visible{color:var(--env2-ink-2);border-color:var(--env2-ink-2)}
.ens-page__brk{margin-block-start:30px}

/* ---------- a section: one h2, one device ---------- */
.ens-page__sec{padding-block:32px 0;scroll-margin-block-start:90px}
.ens-page__h2.env2-h{font-size:25px;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--env2-ink)}
.ens-page__h2 bdi{color:var(--env2-gold)}
.ens-page__h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:700;font-size:18px;line-height:1.2;color:var(--env2-ink)}
.ens-page__intro{margin-block-end:18px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--env2-ink-2);max-inline-size:66ch}
.ens-page__prose{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--env2-ink);max-inline-size:66ch}
.ens-page__note{margin-block-start:22px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--env2-ink-2);max-inline-size:66ch}
.ens-page__rte h2,.ens-page__rte h3{font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:700;color:var(--env2-ink)}
.ens-page__rte img{border-radius:0}
.ens-page__rte ul,.ens-page__rte ol{padding-inline-start:20px}

/* ---------- DEVICE 1 — the places frame (guide §01, R4): one real courtyard, four labels ---------- */
.ens-page__frame{margin-block-start:4px}
.ens-page__places{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));border-block-end:1px solid var(--ens-page-line)}
.ens-page__places li{border-block-start:1px solid var(--ens-page-line)}
.ens-page__places li:nth-child(odd){padding-inline-end:18px}
.ens-page__place{display:block;padding-block:13px;min-block-size:44px}
.ens-page__place-w{display:block;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:700;font-size:17px;line-height:1.1;color:var(--env2-glow)}
.ens-page__place-d{display:block;margin-block-start:3px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--env2-ink-2)}
.ens-page__place-t{display:block;margin-block-start:9px;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:700;font-size:17px;line-height:1.15;color:var(--env2-ink);transition:color .3s}
.ens-page__place-s{display:block;margin-block-start:4px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--env2-ink-2)}
.ens-page__place-m{display:block;margin-block-start:6px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--env2-ink)}
.ens-page__place-m span{color:var(--env2-gold);margin-inline-start:4px}
.ens-page__place:hover .ens-page__place-t,.ens-page__place:focus-visible .ens-page__place-t{color:var(--env2-glow)}

/* ---------- DEVICE 2 — the spine: a hairline rail, the numeral on it ---------- */
.ens-page__spine{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;border-inline-start:1px solid var(--env2-hair-num)}
.ens-page__spine li{position:relative;padding-inline-start:52px;padding-block:4px 20px}
.ens-page__spine li:last-child{padding-block-end:4px}
.ens-page__spine-n{position:absolute;inset-inline-start:14px;inset-block-start:2px;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:700;font-size:22px;line-height:1.1;color:var(--env2-gold)}
.ens-page__spine-t{display:block;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:700;font-size:19px;line-height:1.2;color:var(--env2-ink)}
.ens-page__spine p{margin-block-start:6px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--env2-ink-2);max-inline-size:62ch}

/* ---------- DEVICE 3 — the two-column definition list (guide §03, shipping costs) ---------- */
.ens-page__pair{margin:0;padding:0}
.ens-page__pair > div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:5px 20px;padding-block:14px;border-block-start:1px solid var(--ens-page-line)}
.ens-page__pair > div:last-child{border-block-end:1px solid var(--ens-page-line)}
.ens-page__pair dt{margin:0;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:700;font-size:17px;line-height:1.2;color:var(--env2-ink)}
.ens-page__num{font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:700;color:var(--env2-gold);margin-inline-end:9px}
.ens-page__pair dd{margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--env2-ink-2)}

/* ---------- DEVICE 4 — the checklist: a hollow square, one line each ---------- */
.ens-page__check{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;max-inline-size:66ch}
.ens-page__check li{position:relative;padding-inline-start:30px;padding-block:8px;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--env2-ink)}
.ens-page__check li::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset-inline-start:0;inset-block-start:13px;inline-size:13px;block-size:13px;border:1px solid var(--env2-hair-num)}

/* ---------- DEVICE 5 — the trio: run-in blocks on top hairlines ---------- */
.ens-page__trio{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:0 32px;margin:0}
.ens-page__trio > div{border-block-start:1px solid var(--ens-page-line);padding-block:14px 18px}
.ens-page__trio-t{display:block;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:700;font-size:18px;line-height:1.25;color:var(--env2-ink)}
.ens-page__trio p{margin-block-start:6px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--env2-ink-2);max-inline-size:52ch}

/* ---------- DEVICE 6 — the link run (About «מה תמצאו בחנות») ---------- */
.ens-page__run-list{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px 28px;margin:0;padding:0}

/* ---------- DEVICE 7 — the two columns (why-solar), the licensed pairs on the second ---------- */
.ens-page__cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:26px 40px;margin:0}
.ens-page__plain{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.ens-page__plain li{border-block-start:1px solid var(--ens-page-line);padding-block:11px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--env2-ink-2)}
.ens-page__plain li:last-child{border-block-end:1px solid var(--ens-page-line)}
.ens-page__run{font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:700;font-size:16px;color:var(--env2-glow);margin-inline-end:8px}

/* ---------- DEVICE 8 — the FAQ: native <details>, a chevron of two borders, no JS ---------- */
.ens-page__faq details{border-block-start:1px solid var(--ens-page-line)}
.ens-page__faq details:last-child{border-block-end:1px solid var(--ens-page-line)}
.ens-page__faq summary{position:relative;list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding-block:14px;padding-inline-end:28px;min-block-size:44px;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.4;color:var(--env2-ink)}
.ens-page__faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.ens-page__faq summary::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset-inline-end:6px;inset-block-start:20px;inline-size:8px;block-size:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--env2-gold);border-right:1px solid var(--env2-gold);transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .3s}
.ens-page__faq details[open] summary::after{transform:rotate(-135deg);inset-block-start:24px}
.ens-page__faq details p{padding-block:0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--env2-ink-2);max-inline-size:66ch}

/* ---------- DEVICE 9 — the plate (processing): three cells of one figure each ---------- */
.ens-page__plate{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);margin:0;padding:0;border-block-end:1px solid var(--ens-page-line)}
.ens-page__cell{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:4px 18px;padding-block:13px;border-block-start:1px solid var(--ens-page-line)}
.ens-page__cell dt{margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.35;color:var(--env2-ink-2)}
.ens-page__cell dd{margin:0;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:700;font-size:18px;line-height:1.2;color:var(--env2-ink)}
.ens-page__cell dd bdi{color:var(--env2-gold)}

/* ---------- the signature (About ends signed, R6) and the contact page's email line ---------- */
.ens-page__sign{margin-block-start:34px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--env2-ink)}
.ens-page__sign-who{margin-block-start:8px;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:700;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--env2-ink)}
.ens-page__sign-mail{font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-weight:400;font-size:15px;color:var(--env2-ink-2)}
.ens-page__email{margin-block-start:16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--env2-ink-2)}

/* ---------- the page's one call to action: one gold pill, at most one text link ---------- */
.ens-page__cta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:16px 28px;margin-block-start:28px}

/* ---------- desktop: a designed layout, not a phone column centred in 1366 (R9) ----------
   every section is a two-column grid — the heading in the inline-start column, the reading
   measure (68ch) beside it; the captions sit in the same inline-start margin. */
@media (min-width:901px){
  .ens-page{padding-block-end:76px}
  .ens-page__head{padding-block-start:44px}
  .ens-page__h1.env2-h{font-size:44px}
  .ens-page__lead{font-size:18px;margin-block-start:16px}
  .ens-page__fig--band img{block-size:300px;object-position:var(--ens-op-lg,var(--ens-op,50% 50%))}
  .ens-page__fig--inline img{object-position:var(--ens-op-lg,var(--ens-op,50% 50%))}
  .ens-page__onband{inset-block-end:28px}
  .ens-page__figcap-in{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,300px) minmax(0,68ch);gap:2px 64px;justify-content:start}
  .ens-page__cap,.ens-page__credit{grid-column:1}
  .ens-page__brk{margin-block-start:40px}
  .ens-page__sec{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,300px) minmax(0,68ch);gap:14px 64px;justify-content:start;align-items:start;padding-block-start:48px}
  .ens-page__sec > :not(.ens-page__h2){grid-column:2}
  .ens-page__h2.env2-h{grid-column:1;font-size:30px;margin:0}
  .ens-page__sec > .ens-page__frame{grid-column:1 / -1;margin-block-start:6px}
  .ens-page__places{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}
  .ens-page__places li:nth-child(odd){padding-inline-end:0}
  .ens-page__places li{padding-inline-end:24px}
  .ens-page__spine li{padding-inline-start:60px}
  .ens-page__spine-n{font-size:26px}
  .ens-page__spine-t{font-size:21px}
  .ens-page__spine p,.ens-page__trio p,.ens-page__pair dd,.ens-page__plain li,.ens-page__faq details p,.ens-page__note{font-size:16px}
  .ens-page__pair > div{grid-template-columns:minmax(24ch,auto) minmax(0,1fr);gap:0 24px}
  .ens-page__sec > .ens-page__trio{grid-column:1 / -1}
  .ens-page__trio{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}
  .ens-page__cols{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
  .ens-page__plate{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));border-block-end:0}
  .ens-page__cell{flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-start;gap:6px;padding-inline-end:24px;border-block-end:1px solid var(--ens-page-line)}
}
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ElmsNest S — עמוד תוכן",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "ens-page-section hdt-section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "עיצוב אחד לשבעת עמודי התוכן. הטקסט הארוך יושב בקוד; כאן נמצאים הכותרת הראשית ומשפט הפתיחה של כל עמוד, ותמונה אחת לכל שלב עם הכיתוב והקרדיט שלה." },

    { "type": "header", "content": "מדריך הבחירה" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "h1_guide", "label": "כותרת ראשית", "default": "בוחרים תאורת גינה לפי המקום — לא לפי התמונה" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "lead_guide", "label": "משפט פתיחה", "default": "ארבע החלטות קצרות: איפה צריך אור, מה הוא צריך לעשות, איזה מקור חשמל מתאים, ומה בודקים לפני שמזמינים." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "img_guide_band", "label": "תמונת הפתיחה (ריק = ens-page-guide-band.jpg)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cap_guide_band", "label": "כיתוב תמונת הפתיחה (ריק = בלי כיתוב)", "default": "שמיים בין ערביים" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cred_guide_band", "label": "קרדיט תמונת הפתיחה", "default": "צילום: aenigmatēs (CC BY 2.0)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "alt_guide_band", "label": "טקסט חלופי לתמונת הפתיחה", "info": "ריק = תמונה דקורטיבית; הכיתוב נושא את המשמעות." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "pos_guide_band", "label": "חיתוך בנייד (object-position)", "default": "50% 60%" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "posd_guide_band", "label": "חיתוך במחשב (object-position)", "default": "50% 65%" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "img_guide_places", "label": "תמונת החצר (ריק = ens-page-guide-places.jpg)" },
